OL,3,ARoyal Navy aircraft carrier departs for
OL,4,Atraining
OL,5,
OL,6,FHMS Queen Elizabeth has set sail with
OL,7,Fhundreds of sailors to take part in a
OL,8,Fpre-planned deployment around the UK
OL,9,Fand northern Europe.
OL,11,FThe 65,000-tonne aircraft carrier,
OL,12,Fwhich was commissioned into service in
OL,13,F2017, left Portsmouth Naval Base at
OL,14,Fabout 18:20 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FOver the next three months, the #3.2bn
OL,17,Fwarship and her crew of more than 800
OL,18,Fsailors will take part in an intensive
OL,19,Fprogramme of training, the Royal Navy
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
