OL,3,ARoyal Navy aircraft carrier departs for
OL,4,Atraining
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deployment marks the vessels first
OL,7,Fofficial sailing as Nato's command ship
OL,8,Ffor the Allied Response Force - a
OL,9,Fdesignation it received in July this
OL,10,Fyear.
